 **C6. Legends are inline dot + label.**
 Never a boxed key, never a bordered legend panel.
 
+**C7. Radius and elevation encode containment, so they are not uniform.**
+The containing card is the largest radius on the page (`--ns-radius-3xl`, 24px) and carries the
+diffuse ambient shadow; a panel inside it steps down (`--ns-radius-xl`); every control, chip,
+segmented cell and avatar inside those is a full pill (`--ns-radius-full`). Nothing shares a radius
+with the thing it sits inside.
+*Fails if:* a card, its inner panel and its button all use the same radius, or if a size variant can
+un-round a pill.
+
+**C8. No offset "brutalist" shadow anywhere.**
+Elevation is diffuse and token-driven (`--ns-shadow-*`). A hard offset shadow —
+`box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 …` — is rejected: it reads as a toy, and because it is usually mixed from a
+paper ramp step it becomes a white halo on a dark surface.
+*Fails if:* `assets/ui/**` or `assets/blocks/**` contains a `\d+px \d+px 0` box-shadow. Checked by
+`tests/design_contract_test.ts`.
+
 ## Charts
 
 **H1. Charts are hand-authored SVG over tokens. No charting library.**
 Geometry is computed in TypeScript and emitted as SVG. No dependency renders a chart.

