 **T2. No raw colour literal outside the token files.**
 No hex, no `rgb()`, no `rgba()` in `assets/ui/**` or `assets/blocks/**`. Derived states use
 `color-mix()`, never a new literal.
 
+**T2a. No component touches a ramp step; it touches a role.**
+`--ns-paper-6`, `--ns-rust-6` and their siblings are the *inputs* to the semantic layer, not an API.
+A component reads `--ns-money-neg`, `--ns-destructive`, `--ns-fg`, `--ns-control-thumb` — never
+`--ns-rust-6`. The reason is not tidiness: the paper ramp **inverts** in dark (`paper-12` is
+near-black in light and near-white in dark), so a component that reaches for a ramp step is a
+component that is broken in one theme, and it will not be caught until someone switches.
+*Fails if:* `var(--ns-{paper,ledger,rust,ink,brass,amber}-N)` appears anywhere under `assets/ui/**`,
+`assets/blocks/**` or `components/**`. Checked by `tests/design_contract_test.ts`.
+
 **T3. No component branches on theme.**
 Light and dark are role overrides under `[data-theme='dark']` only. A component that reads the
 current theme is a defect.
 

