 **R2. Gallery counts and ramp orders are read from the manifest, never typed by hand.**
 `RAMP_ORDER` in `(_shared)/tokens.ts` must match the real ramp names in `tokens.json` or a ramp
 silently vanishes from the gallery.
 
+**R3. Ledgerline's own components are catalogued separately from the upstream registry.**
+`ledgerlineCatalog` holds the components this product owns; `registryCatalog` and `registryMeta.total`
+stay a fact about `@netscript/fresh-ui`. Folding app-owned items into the upstream count makes the
+gallery's headline number a lie. Every entry in `ledgerlineCatalog` must have a `case` in
+`renderDemo`. Both are checked by `tests/design_contract_test.ts`.
